{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:13 2026-06-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:13 2026-06-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:13 2026-06-03 HKT</p><p>土瓜灣浙江街13號慈恩學校對開公園，今（3日） 下午2時52分，一名非華裔男子行經上址時，突有5名大漢撲出，將他圍毆，其間有人搶走他的金手鈪及約2000元現金，匪徒得手後四散逃去，事主頭部受傷，負傷報警求助，救護員到場為他包紮後送院敷治，警員在附近搜索賊蹤，惟未有發現。</p><img alt=\"事主在場協查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7b95e4a5ec3683913909db5c0cbf7bc4/2026-06/49c0387f-501b-43d5-bc97-8fadfa153b41.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4e9c8e00b7dfb1c3b9dc7f6727ed5b04/2026-06/89a836be-8677-440d-be71-04935b6c6352.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d77d575f64b2e483a1db52b6f98735a1/2026-06/b9e054e8-988c-41c1-9577-e5f25284569d.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bfde44f8ec4888f1ecff7320bfc70c28/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_15_46_01.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場搜索賊蹤。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/72abf10b671aa451a5172e7acf1324f5/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_15_46_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/506883c685b2b4e6f4fe95a372d4c30b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_15_45_59.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5ddef306da2093357fed3573962f8c00/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_15_45_55_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/80674879b668c01f9153666f20917d95/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-03_at_15_45_55.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-03T08:21:55.976876+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}